<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1596_5777.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Fuersichtigen, Ersamen unnd Weysen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besunder</unclear>
<lb n="2"/>guette <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundt</unclear>, Unnser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willig</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, unnd was wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrn</unclear> liebs unnd guetts
<lb n="4"/>vermoegen, seye E. W. voran bereith, liebe
<lb n="5"/>unnd guette freundt, derselbenden ahn unß
<lb n="6"/>vom <date resp="#ner">16. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Januarij</unclear></date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nechsthin</unclear> gethan <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schriben</unclear>,
<lb n="7"/>darInn Ewer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. unnß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frl</unclear>. ersuechen,
<lb n="8"/>daß dieselben wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbeschwerdt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berichten</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>, in was werth, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gulldin</unclear>
<lb n="10"/>unnd silberne <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muentzsorten</unclear>, alhie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>unnserer statt gehen, ist unnß vor
<lb n="12"/>etlich tagen, wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eingehaendigt</unclear> worden,
<lb n="13"/>dessen ferrnern Inhalltt wir auch
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoeren</unclear> verlesen, Unnd ob wir zwar
<lb n="15"/>E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">W</unclear>. hierauf, gern ballder beantwort,
<lb n="16"/>so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sindt</unclear> unnß doch hiezwischen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehehaffte</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>verhinderungen vorgefallen, dz wir es
<lb n="18"/>bißhero wieder unnsern willen, muessen
<lb n="19"/>einstellen, mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vleiß</unclear> bittendt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear>
<lb n="20"/>derohalb frl. fuer entschulldigt zu-
<lb n="21"/>hallten,
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Belanngenndt</unclear> aber dz werckh <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">an</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sich</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbs</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muessen</unclear> wir neben E. W. bekennen,
<lb n="24"/>dz es mit den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gulldin</unclear> unnd silbernen
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muentzsorten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jetz</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lannge</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear>,
<lb n="26"/>ein solch unbestenndig wesen gehebt,
<lb n="27"/>daß durch darauf vollgennde noch
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hoehere</unclear> steigerung kein ordnung
<lb n="29"/>mer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gellten</unclear>, noch bleiben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>,
<lb n="30"/>wie noch, unnd dahero <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">muentz</unclear>-
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sorten</unclear>, bißhero <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> kein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestenndigen</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>valuar gerichtet werden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kuenden</unclear>,
<lb n="33"/>wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fast</unclear> noch,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1596_5778.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/>wie es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear> bey <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beschaffen</unclear>, hat
<lb n="35"/>es dise <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelegenheit</unclear>, dz wir an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeiner</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">inkommen</unclear> unnd geföll,
<lb n="37"/>die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">golldt</unclear> unnd silber müntzen, bißhero
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">höcher</unclear> nit, allß dem in <date resp="#ner">anno .59.</date> ufgerichten,
<lb n="39"/>müntz edict gemaeß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ufim</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">steürhauß</unclear> und
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">um</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> nemmen lassen, aber
<lb n="41"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alhie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserer</unclear> statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>
<lb n="42"/>dieselben inn hanndtierungen, unnd
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">annders</unclear>, zwischen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgern</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fremb</unclear>-
<lb n="44"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dengehanndlen</unclear>, contract, umb ein mehrers
<lb n="45"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">höcher</unclear> genommen, unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußgeben</unclear>,
<lb n="46"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> so <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ungleich</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unbestenndig</unclear>,
<lb n="47"/>dz wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ietzt</unclear> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lannge</unclear> zeit kein ge-
<lb n="48"/>wissen valor <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darauf</unclear> setzen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">künnden</unclear>,
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonndern</unclear> bißhero <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ieder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeit</unclear>,
<lb n="50"/>inn hoffnung gestannden, es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sollte</unclear>
<lb n="51"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeinen</unclear>
<lb n="52"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reichßschluß</unclear>, bey <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reichß</unclear> oder <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deputa</unclear>-
<lb n="53"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tion</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">taegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewiß</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestennd</unclear>-
<lb n="54"/>iges <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">derohalb</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">statuiert</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemacht</unclear>
<lb n="55"/>werden, wie wir dann verhoffen wöl-
<lb n="56"/>len, dz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollches</unclear> bey disem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fürgenomnen</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">reichßtag</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werde</unclear> beschehen, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sollches</unclear>
<lb n="58"/>auch, wo mann annderst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darüber</unclear>
<lb n="59"/>nit gar <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verderben</unclear>, unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnder</unclear>-
<lb n="60"/>ganng gerathen will, die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hochst</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eusserst</unclear> notturfft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erfordern</unclear> thuet,
<lb n="62"/>wellches E. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">F</unclear>. wir uf <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obberüert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ir</unclear>
<lb n="63"/>schreiben, zu begeretem bericht,
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>. nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sollen</unclear> noch wöllen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verhallten</unclear>,
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sampt</unclear> derselben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beveheln</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ec</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1596_5779.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="66"/>mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angenemer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dienstwilligkeit</unclear> gewogen,
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">datum</unclear> <origDate when="1608" resp="#ner">den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">16</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">8bris</unclear> anno 1608</origDate>.
<lb n="68"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-510" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeister</unclear> unnd rath der
<lb n="69"/>statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vllm</unclear></orgName>,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1596_5780.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="70"/>Den fürsichtigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ersamen</unclear> unnd
<lb n="71"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weißen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> unnd
<lb n="72"/>Rath der statt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> St. Gallen</orgName>,
<lb n="73"/>unnsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besundern</unclear> lieben
<lb n="74"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> freünden.
<lb n="75"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sant Gallen</placeName>,
</p>
